      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SARSAPARILLA KID (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 20.17 beating Smooth Tiger. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. PAW ELODEE (2) turned in a plain performance last time when eighth at Ballarat over 390m behind Kaelix Jewel (23.04) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Worth another chance. DR. ERICA (4) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (20.19) at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Bold showing expected. DR. LOUIS (3) has a solid strike rate at this track and distance.",
